.TH "HED-CLIPBOARD" "1" "2026-08-23" "hed v1.21.3" "hed manual"
.SH NAME
hed\-clipboard \- Mirrors yanks into the system clipboard via OSC 52
\[em] the terminal escape sequence that ships clipboard data over your
existing TTY.
Works over plain SSH with no xclip, pbcopy, or wl\-copy shelling out.
.PP
Mirrors yanks into the system clipboard via OSC 52 \[em] the terminal
escape sequence that ships clipboard data over your existing TTY.
Works over plain SSH with no \f[CR]xclip\f[R], \f[CR]pbcopy\f[R], or
\f[CR]wl\-copy\f[R] shelling out.
.SH What it overrides
.PP
